    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to represent the sale of 36 Maywood Crescent, Raheny, a 4 bedroom semi-detached home oozing potential for the new purchasers. The property boasts large spacious accommodation over two levels and benefits from a good sized rear garden. This superb property is sure to appeal to the family home market looking for a quality home they can put their stamp on..\n\nThe accommodation comprises of an entrance hallway, front living room, kitchen/breakfast room ,second reception and a large garage on ground floor level. Upstairs, first floor accommodates 4 spacious bedrooms and a bathroom.\n\nMaywood Crescent is a quiet, leafy estate situated just off the Howth Road, Raheny. Local amenities include the magnificent St Annes park with wonderful woodland to enjoy and the seafront promenade is a short distance away for those who enjoy a walk by the sea. Local shops can be easily reached on foot and viewers will indeed be hard pushed to improve on the overall combination of a really spacious home with a sunny garden, set in an ideal and mature family home location"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Good sized rear garden</li><li> Off street parking</li><li> Gas heating</li><li> Spacious accommadation</li><li> Sought after location</ul>"
      },
